": "Done. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Diagnosis**\n- checkout-api was running v2.3.1 in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n- Release history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent production release marked healthy. (v2.3.1-rc was staging-only and also unhealthy, so it was not a candidate.)\n\n**Rollback**\n- Rolled checkout-api back to **v2.3.0** in all three production regions. The rollback reported `rolled_out` in us-east, us-west, and eu-west.\n\n**Incident**\n- Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2) for checkout-api, which paged the on-call engineer. The summary describes the failing health checks after the v2.3.1 deploy, the rollback to v2.3.0, and a note that v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging \u2014 worth examining why it was promoted.\n\nOne suggestion: it'd be worth re-checking the service status in a few minutes to confirm the error rate has dropped on v2.3.0 before closing out.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the service status and release history to identify the right rollback target.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_019tVy4itMdnE9rLZPdQJrG4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01GdWTiiAPw9kKY6xbsvh92v", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01RSowCS232GkyjWnFsnjdC2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_u